288→@P = primav(1, "P", 0, uv);
289→@N = primav(1, "N", 0, uv);
290→
291→// primmuv for per-axis UV sampling (tangent/derivative setup)
292→vector gx = primmuv(1, "P", 0, uv.x);
293→vector gy = primmuv(1, "P", 0, uv.y);
294→```
